The Windows native jar uses the Microsoft Visual C++ runtime and OpenMP runtime (vcomp140.dll) of the org.bytedeco:javacpp
windows-x86_64 jar, and the macOS native jar uses Apple Accelerate of the operating system; neither is part of these jars.
